{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はOGA歌謡祭でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん、\nありがとうございます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルール\n扇風機\nＭＣ\n制服のマネキン\n狼に口笛を\n涙がまだ悲しみだった頃\nＭＣ\nおいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルールは\nれいか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"扇風機は\nひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキンは\nみなみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛をは\nひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙がまだ悲しみだった頃は\nゆっきーな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のポジションをやらせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は\n初の触覚なしポニー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"触覚なしのが邪魔じゃないし\nすっきりして見えるって言われたから\nこれはまたいつかやるかも＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天候は怪しかったけど\n楽しいライブでした(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の生きてきた18年と11か月で\n初の秋田だったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きりたんぽも食べれて\n秋田の方々にも会えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充実してた2日間でした(*¨*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/07/14/9430959/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、\n今日乃木坂の次の次に出演されてた\nJuice＝Juiceさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ののとか誌面とかでも言ってるけど\n大好きなんです(*´▽｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"憧れてて、尊敬してて\nそんなJuice＝Juiceさんと\n同じステージに立たせて頂けるだけでも\n感動なのに\n一緒に写メも撮っていただけた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/07/14/9430959/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/07/14/9430959/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Juice＝Juiceさんのステージの間\nステージの裏で独りで全力で踊って\nスタッフさんたちのレス回収しました｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、自重します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}